"""
Writes the wiki pages Performance-History.md and Performance-History-by-Commit.md into the checkout of the performance-history branch from the results of benchmarks/history.py.

    python3 benchmarks/history_page.py [--results PATH] [--out PATH/Performance-History.md]

The page has one part per machine definition (CPU, GPU, OS and version, RAM, VRAM, renderer or converter). In each part the rows are
the revisions, oldest first (the baseline at the top), and every row shows the numbers after its change, with the change against the row
above it. revisions.json lists the revisions and what each one changed.
"""
